"change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Kiosk Mode: A new mode designed for presentations and immersive viewing. It hides controllers and hand-tracking for a distraction-free experience. Access it via the \"Advanced\" button on the control panel.\n\n2. Resume Playback: Added support for resuming videos from where you left off.\n\n3. Menu Button Shortcut: Added the option to open the control panel exclusively using the Menu button to prevent accidental triggers.\n\n4. Performance Optimization: Fixed a lag issue when loading folders with a large number of files (up to 20,000), ensuring smoother browsing.\n", "created_date": 1776045813, "id": "26495417963426196", "version": "1.6.0", "version_code": 2283, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24080849371549746", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26495417963426196"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1884073112134608"}]}, "change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Enhanced Image Mode: Added \"Previous\" and \"Next\" navigation buttons. You can also now switch between images using the controller thumbsticks.\n\n2. Interaction System Overhaul: Improved the overall experience for both controller and hand-tracking, making interactions smoother and more intuitive.\n\n3. Expanded Display Support: Added support for Full SBS and Full Top-Bottom aspect ratios.\n\n4. Stability Improvements: Fixed a crash that occurred on Quest 2 when closing a video, along with general bug fixes to ensure a more reliable user experience.", "created_date": 1773227943, "id": "26152069914427671", "version": "1.5.4", "version_code": 2072, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24080849371549746", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26495417963426196"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1884073112134608"}]}, "change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Enhanced Image Mode: Added \"Previous\" and \"Next\" navigation buttons. You can also now switch between images using the controller thumbsticks.\n\n2. Interaction System Overhaul: Improved the overall experience for both controller and hand-tracking, making interactions smoother and more intuitive.\n\n3. Expanded Display Support: Added support for Full SBS and Full Top-Bottom aspect ratios.\n\n4.Stability Improvements: General bug fixes and performance optimizations to ensure a more reliable and smoother user experience.", "created_date": 1773121939, "id": "26140741908893805", "version": "1.5.3", "version_code": 2046, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24080849371549746", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26495417963426196"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1884073112134608"}]}, "change_log": "New Features and Enhancements:\n\n1. Enhanced Image Mode: Added \"Previous\" and \"Next\" navig